The dish looks like a small bowl, about 15 cm across, holding rigatoni with a creamy sauce, greens, and a breadcrumb topping. The pasta pieces are large and sit in a modest pile, so I estimate about 200 g of food in total.

Cooked pasta with a cream or cheese sauce runs about 1.5 kcal/g. That gives roughly 300 kcal for 200 g. The breadcrumb topping and the sauce add a little more, so I settled on about 310 kcal.

